---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const mailClass =
  'text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-accent';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy — Henry Calligraphy"
  description="Read how Henry Calligraphy uses cookies and similar technologies on this website."
>
  <section class="border-b border-foreground/15">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24">
      <p class="font-sans text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-muted-foreground">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 font-serif text-3xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">1. What are cookies?</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Cookies are small text files that a website stores on your computer or mobile device
            when you visit the site. They help the site remember your actions and preferences for a
            period of time, so you don't have to re-enter them whenever you come back or browse from
            one page to another.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">2. How we use cookies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Henry Calligraphy uses cookies only where they are necessary to provide and improve your
            experience on this website. We do not use cookies to personally identify you.
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-foreground">Essential cookies</strong> — required for the website to
              function correctly, for example to maintain your session or remember your privacy preferences.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-foreground">Analytics cookies</strong> — help us understand how visitors
              interact with the website, such as which pages are visited most often. Where possible, these
              are anonymised.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">3. Third-party cookies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Some cookies may be set by trusted third parties whose services we use, such as
            analytics providers or embedded content platforms. We do not control these cookies and
            recommend reviewing the cookie policies of those services.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">4. Managing cookies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            You can delete or block cookies through your browser settings at any time. Please note
            that disabling certain cookies may affect how this website looks or functions.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">5. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in technology,
            legislation, or our services. The latest version will always be available on this page.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">6. Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            If you have any questions about this Cookie Policy, please contact us at <a
              href="mailto:info@henrycalligraphy.com"
              class={mailClass}>info@henrycalligraphy.com</a
            >.
          </p>
        </section>
        <p class="pt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground/70">Last updated: 4 September 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
